#: ../../../reference/interfaces/ubuntu-pro-control-interface.md:2
msgid "ubuntu-pro-control interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/ubuntu-pro-control-interface.md:4
msgid ""
"`ubuntu-pro-control` allows control of the Ubuntu Pro desktop daemon over D-"
"Bus."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/ubuntu-pro-control-interface.md:6
msgid ""
"This interface lets a connected snap attach or detach the system from Ubuntu "
"Pro, inspect available Pro services and their entitlement/status, and enable "
"or disable individual services."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/ubuntu-pro-control-interface.md:8
msgid ""
"**{ref}`Auto-connect <explanation-interfaces-interface-auto-connection>`**: "
"no</br> **{ref}`Super-privileged <reference-operations-interfaces-super-"
"privileged-interfaces>`**: yes</br>"
msgstr ""

